<body><div style="margin: 0px; font-family: &quot; font-size: 12px"><div style="margin: 0px;"><p style="margin: 16px 0px;"><font color="#000000"><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;"><span style="margin: 0px;">What mindsets, roles, and tasks exist in a transdisciplinary team?</span><span style="margin: 0px;"> </span><span style="margin: 0px;">And </span><span style="margin: 0px;">what</span><span style="margin: 0px;"> </span><span style="margin: 0px;">about</span><span style="margin: 0px;"> </span><span style="margin: 0px;">you</span><span style="margin: 0px;">—</span><span style="margin: 0px;">how</span><span style="margin: 0px;"> </span><span style="margin: 0px;">can</span><span style="margin: 0px;"> </span><span style="margin: 0px;">you</span><span style="margin: 0px;"> </span><span style="margin: 0px;">participate</span><span style="margin: 0px;"> and </span><span style="margin: 0px;">contribute</span><span style="margin: 0px;"> </span><span style="margin: 0px;">to</span><span style="margin: 0px;"> </span><span style="margin: 0px;">the</span><span style="margin: 0px;"> project?</span><span style="margin: 0px;"> </span></span><span lang="NL-NL" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;"><span style="margin: 0px">We </span><span style="margin: 0px">distinguish</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">several</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">tasks</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">and</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">associated</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">roles</span><span style="margin: 0px"> in a </span><span style="margin: 0px">transdisciplinary</span><span style="margin: 0px"> project. These </span><span style="margin: 0px">include</span><span style="margin: 0px">:</span></span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;">&nbsp;</span></font></p></div><div style="margin: 0px;"><ul role="list" style="margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-family: verdana"><li aria-setsize="-1" role="listitem" style="margin: 0px 0px 0px 24px; font-size: 16px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><p style="margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px;"><font color="#000000"><span lang="NL-NL" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold"><span style="margin: 0px">Acting</span></span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></font></p></li></ul></div><div style="margin: 0px;"><ul role="list" style="margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-family: verdana"><li aria-setsize="-1" role="listitem" style="margin: 0px 0px 0px 24px; font-size: 16px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><p style="margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px;"><font color="#000000"><span lang="NL-NL" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold"><span style="margin: 0px">Deciding</span></span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></font></p></li></ul></div><div style="margin: 0px;"><ul role="list" style="margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-family: verdana"><li aria-setsize="-1" role="listitem" style="margin: 0px 0px 0px 24px; font-size: 16px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><p style="margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px;"><font color="#000000"><span lang="NL-NL" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold"><span style="margin: 0px">Facilitating</span></span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></font></p></li></ul></div><div style="margin: 0px;"><p style="margin: 16px 0px;"><font color="#000000"><span lang="NL-NL" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><span style="margin: 0px">Different </span><span style="margin: 0px">roles</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">can</span><span style="margin: 0px">—</span><span style="margin: 0px">and</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">likely</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">will</span><span style="margin: 0px">—overlap.</span></span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></font></p></div><div style="margin: 0px"><p role="heading" aria-level="4" style="margin: 21.2667px 0px; font-style: italic"><font color="#000000"><span lang="NL-NL" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold"><span style="margin: 0px">Acting</span></span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></font></p></div><div style="margin: 0px;"><p style="margin: 16px 0px;"><font color="#000000"><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><span style="margin: 0px">The core task of “acting” in a process involves your own contributions, regardless of your role or stakeholder position.</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">Don’t</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">hesitate</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">to</span><span style="margin: 0px"> take </span><span style="margin: 0px">responsibility</span><span style="margin: 0px">, step </span><span style="margin: 0px">outside</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">your</span><span style="margin: 0px"> comfort zone, and </span><span style="margin: 0px">encourage</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">others</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">to</span><span style="margin: 0px"> do </span><span style="margin: 0px">the</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">same</span><span style="margin: 0px">.</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span></span><span lang="NL-NL" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><span style="margin: 0px">Remember</span><span style="margin: 0px">: </span><span style="margin: 0px">you’re</span><span style="margin: 0px"> in </span><span style="margin: 0px">this</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">together</span><span style="margin: 0px">.</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">Another</span><span style="margin: 0px"> shared attitude </span><span style="margin: 0px">that</span><span style="margin: 0px"> is </span><span style="margin: 0px">intrinsic</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">to</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">transdisciplinarity</span><span style="margin: 0px"> is a </span></span><span lang="NL-NL" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold"><span style="margin: 0px">curious</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">mindset</span></span><span lang="NL-NL" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><span style="margin: 0px">.</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">Since</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">nothing</span><span style="margin: 0px"> is </span><span style="margin: 0px">clear</span><span style="margin: 0px"> at </span><span style="margin: 0px">the</span><span style="margin: 0px"> start of a </span><span style="margin: 0px">transdisciplinary</span><span style="margin: 0px"> project, </span><span style="margin: 0px">you</span><span style="margin: 0px"> must </span><span style="margin: 0px">be</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">willing</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">to</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">explore</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">and</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">generate</span><span style="margin: 0px"> new </span><span style="margin: 0px">knowledge</span><span style="margin: 0px">.</span></span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></font></p></div><div style="margin: 0px"><p role="heading" aria-level="4" style="margin: 21.2667px 0px; font-style: italic"><font color="#000000"><span lang="NL-NL" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold"><span style="margin: 0px">Decision</span><span style="margin: 0px">-Making</span></span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></font></p></div><div style="margin: 0px;"><p style="margin: 16px 0px;"><font color="#000000"><span lang="NL-NL" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><span style="margin: 0px">Decisions</span><span style="margin: 0px"> in </span><span style="margin: 0px">the</span><span style="margin: 0px"> project are made </span><span style="margin: 0px">by</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">various</span><span style="margin: 0px"> actors—</span><span style="margin: 0px">not</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">just</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">those</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">with</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">the</span><span style="margin: 0px"> most </span><span style="margin: 0px">experience</span><span style="margin: 0px"> or </span><span style="margin: 0px">the</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">loudest</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">voice</span><span style="margin: 0px">.</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">In </span><span style="margin: 0px">the</span><span style="margin: 0px"> safe environment of a </span><span style="margin: 0px">transdisciplinary</span><span style="margin: 0px"> project, </span></span><span lang="NL-NL" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold"><span style="margin: 0px">everyone</span><span style="margin: 0px"> must </span><span style="margin: 0px">be</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">heard</span></span><span lang="NL-NL" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">.</span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></font></p></div><div style="margin: 0px"><p role="heading" aria-level="4" style="margin: 21.2667px 0px; font-style: italic"><font color="#000000"><span lang="NL-NL" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold"><span style="margin: 0px">Facilitating</span></span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></font></p></div><div style="margin: 0px;"><p style="margin: 16px 0px;"><font color="#000000"><span lang="NL-NL" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><span style="margin: 0px">At </span><span style="margin: 0px">times</span><span style="margin: 0px">, </span><span style="margin: 0px">one</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">individual</span><span style="margin: 0px"> must </span><span style="margin: 0px">oversee</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">the</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">entire</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">process</span><span style="margin: 0px">, </span><span style="margin: 0px">stimulate</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">breakthroughs</span><span style="margin: 0px">, </span><span style="margin: 0px">and</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">balance</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">group</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">needs</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">with</span><span style="margin: 0px"> practical </span><span style="margin: 0px">constraints</span><span style="margin: 0px">.</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">We call these </span><span style="margin: 0px">individuals</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span></span><span lang="NL-NL" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold">guides</span><span lang="NL-NL" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><span style="margin: 0px">.</span><span style="margin: 0px">&nbsp;</span><span style="margin: 0px"> Guides have </span><span style="margin: 0px">two</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">distinct</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">roles</span><span style="margin: 0px"> in </span><span style="margin: 0px">transdisciplinary</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">projects</span><span style="margin: 0px">:</span></span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></font></p></div><div style="margin: 0px;"><p style="margin: 16px 0px;"><font color="#000000"><span lang="NL-NL" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><span style="margin: 0px">First, </span><span style="margin: 0px">they</span><span style="margin: 0px"> set up </span><span style="margin: 0px">and</span><span style="margin: 0px"> co-design </span><span style="margin: 0px">the</span><span style="margin: 0px"> TRAIL, </span><span style="margin: 0px">and</span><span style="margin: 0px"> later </span><span style="margin: 0px">they</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">foster</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">the</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">processes</span><span style="margin: 0px"> as </span></span><span lang="NL-NL" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold">coaches</span><span lang="NL-NL" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><span style="margin: 0px">.</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">This</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">applies</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">especially</span><span style="margin: 0px">—but </span><span style="margin: 0px">not</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">exclusively</span><span style="margin: 0px">—</span><span style="margin: 0px">to</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">educational</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">settings</span><span style="margin: 0px">, </span><span style="margin: 0px">where</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">teachers</span><span style="margin: 0px"> or fellow </span><span style="margin: 0px">students</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">can</span><span style="margin: 0px"> guide </span><span style="margin: 0px">the</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">learning</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">process</span><span style="margin: 0px"> of </span><span style="margin: 0px">participating</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">students</span><span style="margin: 0px">.</span></span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></font></p></div><div style="margin: 0px;"><p style="margin: 16px 0px;"><font color="#000000"><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">Regardless of the role you take on during the project, you also enter the process from a specific </span><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold">stakeholder position</span><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><span style="margin: 0px">.</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">Your</span><span style="margin: 0px"> prior </span><span style="margin: 0px">experience</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">from</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">this</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">position</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">will</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">almost</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">certainly</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">influence</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">how</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">you</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">experience</span><span style="margin: 0px"> a </span><span style="margin: 0px">transdisciplinary</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">process</span><span style="margin: 0px">.</span></span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></font></p></div></div><div style="margin: 0px; font-family: &quot; font-size: 12px&quot;;"><p style="margin: 16px 0px;"><font color="#000000"><span lang="NL-NL" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;"><span style="margin: 0px">&nbsp;</span><span style="margin: 0px">That’s</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">why</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">the</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">following</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">subpages</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">discuss</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">the</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">roles</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">and</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">tasks</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">for</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">each</span><span style="margin: 0px"> stakeholder, </span><span style="margin: 0px">including</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">typical</span><span style="margin: 0px"> changes in </span><span style="margin: 0px">habits</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">compared</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">to</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">disciplinary</span><span style="margin: 0px"> professional or </span><span style="margin: 0px">educational</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">realities</span><span style="margin: 0px">.</span></span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;">&nbsp;</span></font></p></div></body>
